### ⚠️ Important Considerations

| Topic | Guideline |
|-------|-----------|
| **HTTP Method** | Always `POST`. D365FO custom services don't support GET/PUT/DELETE natively. |
| **Payload Format** | JSON only. Property names must match `[DataMember('Name')]` exactly. |
| **Error Handling** | Throw `error()` or `Exception::Error` for 500 responses. Return structured DataContracts for business errors. |
| **Performance** | Avoid heavy DB operations in service methods. Use `SysOperation` framework for async/long-running tasks. |
| **Versioning** | Create new service groups/classes for breaking changes. D365FO doesn't support URL versioning natively. |
| **Licensing** | Custom service calls consume API request quotas. Monitor via `System administration > Inquiries > API usage`. |

